.* NETWORK: the task menu for network management.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='NETWORK'.
:IMPORT NAME=CFGTCPSNMP PNLGRP=QHTOSCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGNETA PNLGRP=QHCFCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPNETA PNLGRP=QHCFCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=NETWORK HELP=HLPNETWORK KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Network Management
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP=DSPNETA OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD DSPNETA'.Display network attributes
:MENUI HELP=CHGNETA OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?CHGNETA'.Change network attributes
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD DSPSOCSTS'.Display sphere of control (SOC) status
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT4' OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKSOC'.Work with sphere of control (SOC)
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT5' OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU NETPRB'.Network problem handling
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT6' OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD DSPAPPNINF'.Display APPN information
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT7' OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD WRKDSTQ'.Work with distribution queues
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT8' OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD DSPDSTSRV'.Display distribution services
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD DSPDSTLOG'.Display distribution services log
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU TCPADM'.TCP/IP administration
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT12' OPTION=12 ACTION='MENU SVSM'.SystemView System Manager
:MENUI HELP=CFGTCPSNMP OPTION=14 ACTION='CMD CFGTCPSNMP'.Configure SNMP agent
:MENUI HELP='NETWORK/OPT70' OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDNET'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPNETWORK.Network Management - Help
:P.The network as a whole: the system's network attributes, distribution
services and TCP/IP.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT3'.Display sphere of control (SOC) status
:P.Option 3. Runs the DSPSOCSTS command&colon. Display sphere of control
(SOC) status.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT4'.Work with sphere of control (SOC)
:P.Option 4. Runs the WRKSOC command&colon. Work with sphere of control
(SOC).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT5'.Network problem handling
:P.Option 5. Shows menu NETPRB&colon. Network problem handling.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT6'.Display APPN information
:P.Option 6. Runs the DSPAPPNINF command&colon. Display APPN
information.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT7'.Work with distribution queues
:P.Option 7. Runs the WRKDSTQ command&colon. Work with distribution
queues.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT8'.Display distribution services
:P.Option 8. Runs the DSPDSTSRV command&colon. Display distribution
services.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT9'.Display distribution services log
:P.Option 9. Runs the DSPDSTLOG command&colon. Display distribution
services log.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT10'.TCP/IP administration
:P.Option 10. Shows menu TCPADM&colon. TCP/IP administration.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT12'.SystemView System Manager
:P.Option 12. Shows menu SVSM&colon. SystemView System Manager.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='NETWORK/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDNET&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
